e=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJSZ3-5B\" fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\"></use>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(695,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(-11,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(1511,675)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(0,-725)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-37\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-28\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(890,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMATHI-6B\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(1633,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-2B\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(2634,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(3134,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-29\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(4513,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(0,675)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-30\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(0,-725)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJSZ3-5D\" fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" x=\"5876\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"13860\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The inductive step is where most of the work lies. The idea is to rewrite the left-hand side of this equation using the inductive hypothesis and apply algebraic techniques to show that this equals the right-hand side.</p>\n<p>Once we're shown that <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"17.796ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 7662 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-17-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-17-Title\">P(k) \\Rightarrow P(k+1),</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E17-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E17-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E17-MJMATHI-6B\" d=\"M121 647Q121 657 125 670T137 683Q138 683 209 688T282 694Q294 694 294 686Q294 679 244 477Q194 279 194 272Q213 282 223 291Q247 309 292 354T362 415Q402 442 438 442Q468 442 485 423T503 369Q503 344 496 327T477 302T456 291T438 288Q418 288 406 299T394 328Q394 353 410 369T442 390L458 393Q446 405 434 405H430Q398 402 367 380T294 316T228 255Q230 254 243 252T267 246T293 238T320 224T342 206T359 180T365 147Q365 130 360 106T354 66Q354 26 381 26Q429 26 459 145Q461 153 479 153H